window.products.push({"id":206194,"name":"Fukosila Stainless Steel Lunch Box, 2 Compartment Leak-Proof Bento Box with Built-in Utensils Box for Kids and Aldults To-go Lunch Containers with Ins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I9+SRMznL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍱Built-in Cutlery Box - Fukosila stainless steel lunch box comes with built-in cutlery box, and comes with BPA Free utensils, you can store cutlery in the cutlery box, keep the cutlery clean during carrying, and use more assured. 🥪Separate Compartments - Fukosila leak-proof bento box 2 compartments separate hot and cold food, and the lid design with food-grade silicone rings to seal the compartments independently, preventing food mixing and keeping food fresh and delicious. 🌮Sealed Leak-proof - Fukosila kids lunch box lid is sealed with 4 snaps. When closing the lid, please place the lid level the base to ensure the sealing of the lid. 2 compartments with independent air vents, the lunch box has strong sealing performance, please open the air vents first to exhaust when it is difficult to open the lid. 🥩304 Stainless Steel Liner - Fukosila lunch containers is made of 304 stainless steel, which is an alternative to plastic lunch boxes and takeaways and is safer for meal prep. The food-grade PP base is insulated to prevent hot hands and is safe for kids to use. The capacity is 1200ml and the size is 21.5*21.5*7cm. Fukosila presents you with a high-quality insulated lunch bag for worry-free on-the-go. 🍕Easy to Clean - Fukosila bento lunch box is dishwasher safe, but it is recommended to wash the lid by hand to prevent the silicone ring from being deformed by heat and affect the leak-proof seal of the lunch box to prolong the life of the lunch box. ✅Statement: The inner tank of Fukosila is made of thickened 304 stainless steel, the edges are finely polished (The quality can be seen from the picture.), and each product is strictly inspected manually before sending. If there is any quality problem with the product, you can contact us for a refund and get a new one for free, you can always contact us to verify the commitment. Do not believe any language maliciously slandering the quality of Fukosila, Fukosila team will respond 24 hours a day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I9+SRMznL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fukosila","source_asin":"B0BBJFRKWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBJFRKWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBJFRKWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":206195,"name":"Merryword Beige Sheet Set 100% Eucalyptus Organic Sheets Tencel Lyocell Sheets King Size Cooling Silk Soft Breathable Moisture-Wicking Deep Pocket Ant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aghJ0CgXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Eucalyptus Tencel - Tencel lyocell fiber harvested from a sustainably grown eucalyptus forest in Austria.Compared with cotton and bamboo,tencel lyocell use less water & energy in the manufacturing process and more sustainable.Our 100% tencel lyocell sheets are the eco-friendliest. Eco-friendly, Moisture Wicking Sheet Set - Our eucalyptus lyocell sheet set made in closed loop process that is free of toxic chemicals, ensuring that 99.9% of all water and solvents are recycled. Eucalyptus product is 3x more breathable and 70% more moisture wicking than cotton,quickly releases it to provide the perfect dry sleeping environment, ideal for hot sleeper. Silky Soft & Smooth - Eucalyptus sheet set feels soft smooth and silky to touch, softer than silk, silky than cotton, and cooler than linen. Sleeping in the heavenly sheet set, wake up in a full energy morning. Are you deserve it, you should say it loudly, YES! Use It When Opening Box - There is no need to wash your eucalyptus sheet set before use – unless that is your preference, of course. Machine wash in cold water in gentle cycle,line dry if possible; otherwise, place in dryer and tumble dry on low. Perfect Snug Fit Your Mattress - 100% Tencel Lyocell King Size Sheet Set Include:1 Flat sheet (110\" x 104\"), 1 Fitted Sheet (78\" x 80\"), 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 40\").Premium encased elastic runs continuously around all four sides to keep the fitted sheet in place.All-round elastic deep pocket that fits over-sized mattresses 12 inches deep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aghJ0CgXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merryword","source_asin":"B0B1LGKVX4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1LGKVX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1LGKVX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":206196,"name":"PEARLANERA Helios Fragrance with a Warm Gourmand, Vanilla and Coffee Scent Accords. An Arabian Oud Eau De Parfum Spray for Unisex 3.4 Ounce. Fragancia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qa5UyPZ3L._SL1280_.jpg","description":"NEW SIGNATURE SCENT. HELIOS is developed to place a well balanced freshly spiced, yet energetically citrus, semi-floral perfume in the hands of our fans. The top note opens with a citrus splash of grapefruit, with the warmth of cardamom and the softness of rosemary. The floral heart of tuberose and ylang ylang has been balanced with the mineralizing oliban. The leathery base of suede has the woody appeal of cedar wood and the lingering aroma of vetiver. Suitable to be worn any time. LONG LASTING EAU DE PARFUM QUALITY. The superior, long lasting, high quality fragrance essence; Perfect for gift-giving or for wearing in a variety of situations; Formulated for long wearing aroma projection and wearable intensity. A CLASSIC FORMULATION FEATURING OUR UNIQUE FRAGRANCES. A versatile, classic fragrance formula; Best suited for everyday wear and ideal for layering with other fragrances; Carefully crafted ingredients are suitable for those with sensitive skin. A MIX OF CULTURES AND PERFUMES. Carrying a legacy rooted in a blend of Western & Oriental craftsmanship, PEARLA NERA is a brand founded on duality that proudly celebrates the space in which two seemingly opposite worlds come together. A French, Italian, Swiss, Kuwait and Bahrain based collaboration of perfumers. AN AROMATIC EXPERIENCE. Born from precious beginnings and built on achievements aplenty, our exquisite creations will lead you on an aromatic journey of the senses that culminates in an impeccable moment that enchants forever. SAMPLES: Part of PEARLANERA Collezione Artigianale (Artisnal Blends) EDP Discovery Set, you can try it along with several other great parfums in that series and range of Oudh Perfumes and Middle Eastern Attar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qa5UyPZ3L._SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PEARLANERA","source_asin":"B0BNG3VFQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNG3VFQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNG3VFQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
