window.products.push({"id":206211,"name":"Storage Bins with Lids-78 Quart Plastic Storage Bins,5 Packs Stackable Storage Bins with Wheels,White X-Large Classroom Storage Bins,Dual Open Collaps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":237.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cuYQ7RABL._AC_SL1149_.jpg","description":"【Foldable & Quick Installation】Wookon Storage bins with lids is a foldable storage box,You can assemble the storage bins with a very simple way within 30 seconds,when you don't need it,the plastic storage bins can be foldable for underbed storage,the collapsible feature can help you save much space. 【Moveable &Stackable 】The stackable storage bins are made of durable and heavy-duty PP material, which is sturdy and durable. The Large storage cubes with doors built in four flexible moverable wheels on the bottom which make it able to move when doing cleaning. It is stackable and allows to stack the bin together tightly. There have four deep grooves in the top lid of storage bins with lids to match with the wheel,so never worry about the plastic storage bins falling down. 【Clear Door and Two Opening Ways】The white storage bins with lids is able to open in two ways. You can open lid on the top of the folding storage box or open from the front door. The front door built in lock buckles, ensure the doors don't just come open on their own. The front door of clear storage bins with lids make it easy to access to everything inside without having to pull everything down or removing the things on the top lid. Keeps things from being exposed to dust. 【X-Large Storage Capacity】The size of closet organizers and storage:25.6Lx15Wx14H inches x 5 Packs (3.8\" Folded), Maximum load capacity totally 100 Gal. The Large storage bins with lids can bear weight up to 190 Pounds. Handle design on the both side, perform well in lifting the clothing storage bins up. This is a space saver, a must have for household, an ideal wardrobe clothes organizer for folded clothes that keep your home neat and tidy. 【Multi Functional Storage】The folding storage box is a very flexible storage containers,you could stack it in different height and used as bedroom storage,kitchen storage bin,bathroom organizer,clothing storage,office storage,snack storage,or quilt storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cuYQ7RABL._AC_SL1149_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wookon","source_asin":"B0C1CTZ7K2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1CTZ7K2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1CTZ7K2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
