window.products.push({"id":206355,"name":"AKTI Premium Cotton Wash Cloths, Pack of 12, 13x13 Inches, 520 GMS, Durable, Quick Dry & Extra Absorbent Cleaning Cloth for Home, Spa, Hotel, Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nxG+NEsGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wash Clothes 12 Pack - Hotel & Spa Collection: These soft washcloths are knitted of 100% organic cotton, which make them super soft, durable & absorbent. These premium wash cloths can be used as multipurpose such as face wash cloth, kids washcloths, dish wash cloths, kitchen washcloths, makeup washcloths, wash cloths for your body, rags for cleaning, rags for bathing, travel washcloth & more. Bigger Size & High GSM - Cleaning Towels For Housekeeping : Get the most out of your cleaning routine with these premium washcloths extra large size of 13 * 13 inches. Made using a high 520 GSM weave, each cotton washcloth is thick enough to stand up to tough scrubbing and durable enough for daily use. This grey towels cotton rags material is lightweight and airy so it wipes and dries quickly, allowing you to move on with your day faster. Reusable Cleaning Cloths / Wash Rags for Multipurpose Use : Whether you're tackling chores around the house or caring for a little one, simplify clean up with this multipurpose use grey wash cloths. These 100% cotton washcloths are perfect for cleaning counters. You can use these wash cloths for your face and body as a face towel, facial towels, fingertip towels, terry towels, cotton towels, body towels, makeup towels, small towels, spa towels & salon towels. Quick Dry Washcloth - Soft Fabric, Extra Absorbent & Durable Quality : This quick dry towel cloth features a soft fabric design, making it extra absorbent and durable. Perfect for washing dishes and other surfaces around your home, you can easily keep this bulk washcloths - pack of 12 completely free from germs with its quick-dry feature. Make your cleaning routine more efficient with these convenient and affordable AKTI terry cloth rags with getting a feel of luxury towels & soft towels. Washing & Care Instructions : Wash before first use. Simply wash them in a machine with warm water and tumble dry on low, remove promptly from the dryer. Avoid using fabric softener or dryer sheets to maintain the look, feel and performance of your washcloths grey. Do not iron, before using the towel to restore the fluff and pile. Always follow care label instructions for best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nxG+NEsGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKTI","source_asin":"B0BXXQ8KHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXXQ8KHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXXQ8KHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
