window.products.push({"id":206361,"name":"SilverStone CXi Ceramic Nonstick Frying Egg Pan/Skillet with Mini Cooking Turner, 5 Inch, Ocean Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PsIq87WiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One and one add up to a powerhouse kitchen team of two, with the perfectly-sized, perfectly-versatile cooking partners in the SilverStone(r) Ceramic Nonstick Cookware CXmini Skillet and Turner Set. SilverStone(r) Ceramic Nonstick Cookware is a pleasure to cook with because this individually-sized small skillet features PFOA-, PTFE- and cadmium-free ceramic nonstick in distinctive white. And because this 5-inch aluminum skillet is the perfect size for an egg or two any style, reheating a hamburger patty, or even a small side of vegetables, it's a go-to pan morning, noon, and night. Mini yet mighty, the skillet allows you to cook just what you want to, without using a larger pan. Better yet, the skillet comes with a sturdy, 8.75\" Prestige(r) nylon slotted turner whose blade fits across the pan surface perfectly. Durable cookware construction helps deliver steady, even heating throughout the pan, and the double-riveted handle provides a solid, comfortable grasp. The turner and the skillet are both dishwasher safe, and handwashing the ceramic nonstick is easier than with traditional nonstick or stainless steel interiors. Oven safe to 350 Degree F (turner excepted), with a Lifetime Limited Warranty, the mini skillet makes a great addition to the other pots and pans from SilverStone(r) Ceramic Nonstick Cookware. Get two mini-sized kitchenware pieces combined into one versatile, dynamic duo with the colorful and convenient SilverStone(r) Ceramic Nonstick Cookware CXmini Skillet and Turner Set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PsIq87WiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SilverStone","source_asin":"B07ZLMLL59","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZLMLL59","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZLMLL59","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":206362,"name":"ColorJoy Coloring Products, Drink Coasters, 6 Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VGWTXJDJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Introducing Color Joy Coloring Products by DCI. This exciting new line of coloring products has something for everyone, including DCI classic gifts. The wide variety of products allows the coloring enthusiast to share their joy of coloring with the world! Tired of adult coloring being limited to just coloring books? These items allow you to display your custom artwork through fun patterns, decorative designs, and in unique formats. Looking for a great Birthday Gift for Mom, a unique coffee mug for Father's Day, or the perfect stocking stuffer for Christmas gifts? The Color Joy product line can be gifted as a coloring activity or given as a unique gift that shows you took the time to create personalized gifts! Best if used with DCI Gel Pens or DCI Colored Pencils. Keep on the look out for more Color Joy products launching over the coming months!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VGWTXJDJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ColorJoy","source_asin":"B01I4QCHTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I4QCHTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I4QCHTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":206363,"name":"+Steel Non-Slip Mixing Bowl Set of 4 Stainless Steel Bowls with Lids and Grater/Slicer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X2nm8zClL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The +Steel Mixing Bowl Set with Grater Whip, blend, emulsify, knead, and toss whatever needs mixing in this masterfully refined set of multi-sized stainless steel mixing bowls. In addition to the fixed measurement indicators engraved into the steel, each bowl comes with a non-skid silicone bottom for easy use on every surface, from slippery kitchen counters to unsteady picnic tables. The set comes with stainless steel graters and a slicer lid insert for the largest bowl to make food prep tidy and quick, also included is a stainless steel whisk for blending dry spices, mixing salad dressings beating eggs, whipping creams, and more. Designed to outlast their owners desire to cook, these four bowls are the very best in performance, durability, and versatility. Use Our Mixing Bowl Set was created to provide a wide range of versatile uses to our +Steel Customers. Four different sizes of bowls means there  will always be a convenient size for your particular needs. The lids allow a much more convenient food storage ability without the need for tin foil  or plastic wrap. With the addition of the measurement indicators there is a lessened reliance on measuring cups during the baking process. The set has grater/slicer inserts for the lid of the largest bowl, allowing convenient food prep as well as allowing you to use the whisk or a mixer without worrying about creating a mess. Our Mixing Bowl Set also includes a All Stainless Steel Whisk which was a logical edition to the set. Specifications & Care The sizes for the bowls are 1Qt, 1.5Qt, 3Qt, 5Qt all with matching lids. The bowls are also made from commercial kitchen grade stainless steel as well as a increased thickness of steel to ensure they last a lifetime. Dishwasher Safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X2nm8zClL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"+Steel","source_asin":"B07322T8CB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07322T8CB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07322T8CB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
