window.products.push({"id":206565,"name":"Design Toscano Kitten Kibitzing Cat Cast Iron Sculptural Bookend Pair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81apZc15PfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pair of playful kittens are sitting pretty just waiting someone to come along and dangle a string, then they will spring into action with classic self-confident, beguiling grace. Cats known as \"Mau\" were revered and important to Egyptian society and religion. These enigmatic black kittens will keep your secrets, Gothic tales, mysteries, or Bram Stoker and Edgar Allen Poe volumes safe from harm. Bookends serve as punctuation marks in a library, showcasing your interests, and adding character to any room, shelf, or credenza. This ideal heavyweight pair of Kitten Kibitzing bookends serve as functional art while giving literary support to your favorite books. Hand-crafted in heavyweight foundry cast iron exclusively for Design Toscano, then hand painted and distressed just enough to replicate a true antique. Each 4\"Wx3½ \"Dx5\"H. 3 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81apZc15PfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Design Toscano","source_asin":"B0BYPKLWML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYPKLWML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYPKLWML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
