window.products.push({"id":206716,"name":"Dormir Twin XL Cotton Sheets Set Dark Blue 400 Thread Count, 3 Piece Sateen Weave Long Staple Cotton Bed Sheet Set, 16 inches Twin XL Size Deep Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FtonE3RDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TWIN XL DARK BLUE SHEET SET: 3-piece set includes 1 fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet and 1 pillow cover. Twin XL size fitted sheet measure 39”x 80” with 14\" deep pocket which fits mattresses up to 16\" and includes strong elastic all around (not just the corners, like other sheets). Flat sheet measure 66”x 102” and Standard size pillowcase measure 20”x 30”. The set is confectioned with a stylish 4\" hem detailing for an elegant look. Sheet sets also available in Cal King, Queen, Full and Twin sizes. 100% PURE COTTON: Our cotton sheet sets are exquisitely made with genuine 400 thread count long-staple combed cotton which ensures adequate thickness along with superior durability of the fabric. We use finest cotton yarns for our fabric and loved by customers for its high quality, softness, and comfort. These cotton yarns are expertly sateen woven together to produce linens which adds a superior silky smooth and lustrous sheen to enhance the look of this bedding set. HYPOALLERGENIC AND EASY CARE SHEETS: Our sheets are not treated with harsh or harmful chemicals and do not leave a strong smell, so you can sleep peacefully. They are hypoallergenic, so those with sensitive skin can rest comfortably instead of being further irritated at night. These sheets are also very easy to clean and can be tumbled dried on low heat. Easy care of our sheet set make it ideal for a busy and modern lifestyle. CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 by <b>OEKO-TEX&#174</b>: All our products are certified STANDARD 100 by <b>OEKO-TEX&#174</b>. According to the guidelines, these products are tested for harmful substances and produced in our environmentally friendly and socially compliant factory. Everything from the yarn to fabric to dyes, workmanship, and accessories like sewing thread, buttons, and zippers are all thoroughly inspected to ensure highest quality standards. NO RISK PURCHASE 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Our #1 goal is to offer you the most amazing products at the best prices for the ultimate customer experience. We are super confident in the quality and comfort of our products and we offer a 100% satisfaction guarantee! Join thousands of happy customers, including luxury hotels. Click Add-to-Cart to order your set today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FtonE3RDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dormir Fine Linen","source_asin":"B097RP9KXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097RP9KXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097RP9KXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
