window.products.push({"id":206722,"name":"Purple Rose Keepsake Urn - Small Urn for Human Ashes with Premium Box & Bag - Rose Urn for Ashes - Honor Your Loved One with Mini Cremation Urn - Fune","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HCl9louXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFUL PURPLE ROSE KEEPSAKE URN: Give your cherished one the love they deserve. Our purple rose urn for men and women has been handmade with love and care. The mini urn has a threaded screw top ensuring the remains of your loved one are kept secure. The bottom of the mini purple urn is covered with quality material felt for better grip and stability. This beautiful purple rose urn will honor your loved one forever. HANDCRAFTED KEEPSAKE URN: The purple rose cremation urn for ashes is handcrafted to deliver the most unique product. This unique keepsake urn will cherish your special relationship with your loved one. The memorial urn is 2.9 inches approx tall and can hold around 3 cubic inches approx of ash. The mini purple urn is made by hand, small imperfections/differences can happen and are part of the quality of a handmade product. INCLUDES PREMIUM BOX: The purple rose keepsake urn comes with a high-quality premium black colored box and a velvet pouch. This beautiful box is perfect for carrying and storing the small cremation urn. HIGH QUALITY & DURABLE PURPLE ROSE URN: This beautiful mini urn is solid and made of high-quality aluminum with shiny finish. The intricate ash urn design is handmade by highly skilled craftsmen using traditional time-honored techniques. You can be rest assured that this small rose keepsake urn for human ashes will last generations. PEACE OF MIND WITH OUR 30 DAYS RETURN POLICY: Our goal is to provide top-quality funeral urn for women that will meet or exceed your expectations. If the product is found unsatisfactory, you can return the item within 30 days after delivery for a prompt replacement or refund. No restocking charges, no hassle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HCl9louXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Solace Forever","source_asin":"B0BVWCBYLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVWCBYLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVWCBYLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
