window.products.push({"id":206776,"name":"Vabaso Electric Lunch Box Food Heater, 2 in 1 Portable Heated Lunch Box for Car Truck Home Work Adults Food Heating, Leak Proof, 1.5L Removable Stainl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p4xHjQRqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy Warm & Healthy Meals --- This food warmer lunch box makes you enjoy warm and healthier home-cooked meals. Get it plugged 30mins to 1hour before mealtime for self heating, you will having a hot lunch and don’t have to pay for fast food. Tip: recommend adding some stock or water to food for heating up faster and evenly. 2 IN 1 Car & Home Use --- Electric heating lunch box contains two different plugs: one for Work/Home (110V), one for Car/Truck (12V/24V). People who on the road for lunch or without access to a microwave, such as truck/Uber driver/office worker will be able to enjoy hot homemade food in the car/office. Safe Material & Easy To Clean --- Portable heated lunchbox made of premium PP plastic and 304 stainless steel, which is safe and durable. Contains a 1.5L removable stainless steel container and a 0.45L plastic box for fruit storage, they are dishwasher safe. Warm Tips: Don't cleaning the heating base with water, Don't add water to the heating base to avoid short circuits. Improved Sealing Lid --- Leak-proof seal gasket is installed on the lid for a better seal to prevent liquid food spill out during bumps. For closing the cover properly and smoother, please lock the short snaps first and then lock the long snaps. Do not turn the lunchbox upside down to avoid liquid leak out from the steam port on the lid. Lifetime Satisfaction Guarantee --- We hope the lunch box is worth having and make your life better. Please contact us if there is any problem with it heating up. Even if missed the return window, we will send you a brand new lunchbox or give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p4xHjQRqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vabaso","source_asin":"B09Q8YZT6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q8YZT6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q8YZT6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":206777,"name":"6-inch Lobster Cracker, Cast Steel, Nut and Seafood Cracker, Professional Crab Cracker by Tezzorio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EmpN6eLrL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Tezzorio 6-inchCast Steel Lobster Crackers are a must-have tool for seafood enthusiasts who enjoy cracking open shells with ease. Whether you're preparing lobster or crab at home or in a professional kitchen, these lobster crackers are a reliable and versatile choice. The cast steel construction of these crackers ensures durability, resistance to corrosion, and long-lasting use. The comfortable grip provides a firm and secure hold, allowing you to apply the necessary pressure to crack open even the toughest of shells without damaging the meat inside. With our lobster crackers, you can easily work on different types of seafood at the same time, making meal preparation more efficient and enjoyable. These versatile crackers are not only ideal for cracking open lobster and crab shells but can also be used for other shellfish like clams, mussels, and oysters, as well as for cracking nuts and hard-boiled eggs. The Tezzorio 6-inch Cast Steel Lobster Crackers are dishwasher safe, making them easy to clean and maintain. Simply wash them with soap and water or place them in the dishwasher for hassle-free cleaning. As a Tezzorio product, you can be confident in the quality and craftsmanship of our lobster crackers. They are designed with both functionality and style in mind, ensuring that they are not only an essential kitchen tool but also an attractive addition to your kitchenware collection. Tezzorio Cast Steel Lobster Crackers are an excellent investment for anyone who enjoys seafood and wants to make cracking open shells a breeze. Order yours today and take the first step towards effortless and enjoyable seafood preparation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EmpN6eLrL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tezzorio","source_asin":"B06XXQXWH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XXQXWH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XXQXWH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":206778,"name":"Improvement Weatherby Bathroom Pedestal Sink Storage Cabinet - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51akrWmnZeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our Weatherby Bathroom cabinets provide excellent storage solutions for bathrooms with limited space or unique fixtures. The Weatherby Pedestal Sink Storage Cabinet cleverly uses the space under your sink to provide convenient hidden storage for toilet tissue and other bathroom supplies. It has 2 doors with magnetic closures that conceal 2 interior shelves with lips on the back to prevent items from falling off. The top of the cabinet can be used for towels or a soap dish. Made of wood and wood composites, this storage cabinet has a classic white finish with brushed nickel hardware. Assembly required. Dimensions: Overall: 21\"W x 14\"D x 24\"H Cutout: 8\"W x 8-1/2\"D Base: 3-1/2\"H Inside: 17\"W x 13\"D (including cut out)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51akrWmnZeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Improvement","source_asin":"B00RLR9CJA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RLR9CJA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RLR9CJA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
