window.products.push({"id":206920,"name":"TECBOT Robot Vacuum Cleaner, 2000Pa Strong Suction, WiFi/App/Alexa, Automatic Charging Robotic Vacuum Cleaner, Ultra-Quiet and Efficient Robot Vacuum ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j1twwCVSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful Suction】The 2000Pa robot vacuum cleaner combo can quickly remove dust, paper scraps, and other garbage., suitable for all hard floors, such as laminate, ceramic tiles, granite, parquet, etc. 【Smart App & Voice Control】You can easily create a home clean schedule, change the clean mode, and control the clean direction by using the Smart App. The auto vacuum robot is also compatible with Alexa and Google Assistant, allowing users to make the robot start and stop the clean by voice commands. Remote control is also included in the package for your convenience. (⚠The APP only supports 2. 4GHz WiFi.) 【Intelligent Obstacle Avoidance Upgraded Again】The robot vacuum has advanced 3D precise obstacle avoidance function, a full set of sensors can intelligently identify and avoid white walls, stairs, and obstacles. 2.9'' slim design helps the robot vacuum cleaner to reach every corner of a house or narrow space, clean leftover dirty areas. 【120mins Runtime & Self-charging】Both mopping and vacuuming offer two levels of intensity adjustment, adjustable for different floor types. With 2600mAh battery capacity, the robotic vacuum cleaner can continuously work 120min in a 1290sqft house, and will automatically back to the charging base. 【4 High-Efficiency Cleaning Modes】The robot vacuum can be flexibly switched between different modes through the remote control or APP (Auto/Spot /Edge/Zig-zag cleaning) to meet the different cleaning needs of the family. Among them, the zigzag path can cover the largest area for cleaning, reduce missed scanning, and increase efficiency by 30%. 【Advantaged Brushless Suction Port-No Hair Entanglement Any More】This robotic vacuum cleaner is powered by a strong digital motor. The robot vacuum has strong suction power and a unique air inlet design, which will not be blocked by pet hair like other robot vacuum cleaners with roller brushes, Ideal for pet families.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j1twwCVSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TECBOT","source_asin":"B0BLMYP478","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-206920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLMYP478","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLMYP478","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
